# Fixture payloads are byte-exact. At least one GitHub delivery carries CRLF on
# purpose, and Windows is in the CI matrix, where core.autocrlf would rewrite
# line endings on checkout and corrupt the payload before a test ever ran.
# The second pattern is the one that matches crates/*/fixtures/: a pattern with
# an interior slash is anchored to the directory holding this file.
fixtures/** -text
**/fixtures/** -text
